{
  "settings": {},
  "_comment": [
    "ORDER MATTERS, AND NOT THE WAY IT LOOKS. Hotwire Native merges the",
    "properties of every rule whose pattern matches, with LATER rules winning",
    "(PathConfiguration#properties: `properties.merge(rule.properties) { _, new in new }`).",
    "Patterns are unanchored regexes, so `.*` matches every path.",
    "",
    "The catch-all therefore has to come FIRST, as the baseline that specific",
    "rules below override. It used to sit last, which silently defeated every",
    "modal rule in this file — auth, lessons and /new have all been presenting",
    "as plain pushes regardless of what they asked for.",
    "",
    "Keep the most specific rules at the bottom.",
    "",
    "This file is served to the app by ConfigurationsController and must stay",
    "identical to langlets-ios/langlets/langlets/Configuration/path_configuration.json,",
    "which is the offline fallback. A test enforces it."
  ],
  "rules": [
    {
      "patterns": [".*"],
      "properties": {
        "context": "default",
        "pull_to_refresh_enabled": true
      }
    },
    {
      "patterns": ["/users/auth/.*", "/users/sign_in", "/users/sign_up", "/users/password/new"],
      "properties": {
        "context": "modal",
        "pull_to_refresh_enabled": false
      }
    },
    {
      "patterns": ["/onboarding/language"],
      "properties": {
        "context": "default",
        "pull_to_refresh_enabled": false
      }
    },
    {
      "patterns": ["/courses/.*/lessons/.*"],
      "properties": {
        "context": "modal",
        "pull_to_refresh_enabled": false
      }
    },
    {
      "patterns": ["/review_lessons/.*"],
      "properties": {
        "context": "default",
        "pull_to_refresh_enabled": false
      }
    },
    {
      "patterns": ["/new$", "/import_courses/new"],
      "properties": {
        "context": "modal",
        "pull_to_refresh_enabled": false
      }
    },
    {
      "patterns": ["^/app$", "^/app/library$", "^/app/import_requests$"],
      "properties": {
        "context": "default",
        "presentation": "replace_root",
        "pull_to_refresh_enabled": true
      }
    },
    {
      "patterns": ["^/app/import_requests/new$", "^/app/credits$"],
      "properties": {
        "context": "modal",
        "modal_style": "medium",
        "pull_to_refresh_enabled": false
      }
    }
  ]
}
